{"id": "1546461577119531048", "channel_id": "1546436469432787014", "author_id": "232682070667689985", "author_name": "rivenscursed", "content": "Hello! I don't usually do team recs but this felt like a fun challenge and nobody has answered yet. \n\nI recently posted a wave 5 guide that may help you (https://discord.com/channels/1131791637933199470/1546428923288494140)\n\nIf you only want team lineups, try these team combos: (some wods and covenants are added to the codes too!)\n**wave1** @@xsWA6czbxVraaybabnBsh@@\n**wave2** @@4qLJayAaxDvKaaonBdh@@\n**wave3** @@3UMxfyiMaaxrxiHnsDnBh@@\n**wave4** @@hxjNIxYIyWaaa0abAnDh@@\n**wave5** @@rgpxlCVZxRzfay8aDndoh@@\n\nwave1 is the easiest but final boss deals huge damage, so you should use your best dps and c:lotan seems to be your fave! \nwave 2 is icefield so caraboo is very helpful and counter\nwave 3 is only one boss fight, so ultra is very beneficial here\nwave 4 has a huge shield and does sacrifice, so dps gmurphy works great, otherwise ghelot helps a lot!\nwave 5 has many complicated mechanics; icefield, favors healing and does huge damage. if you don't use the arachne support build (where you can put your lv1 chaos characters on), i'd highly recommend celeste, caraboo (if not used for wave 2), caecus with his rouse activated for slow but steady counter damage with lots of healing or votice to make use of her pursuit, the newest wod featuring doll is very effective here too!\n\nIf you want to use support on wave 5, here's the Arachne carry and my suggested lineups:", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:06:11.852000+00:00", "thread_id": "1546436469432787014", "attachments": [{"id": "1546461576272416788", "filename": "arachne_support.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2026555, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1546436469432787014/1546461576272416788/arachne_support.png?ex=6a9fde13&is=6a9e8c93&hm=fc49dbd6a0152a8a6a1177311ad933105e24142262ccb7b3b9aa7a31b3abcb09&"}, {"id": "1546461576708751470", "filename": "dzone_lineups_by_eko.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 3780963, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1546436469432787014/1546461576708751470/dzone_lineups_by_eko.png?ex=6a9fde13&is=6a9e8c93&hm=dbc10d546322b089269b801d2f604821073b6040cfa1b087168378baa000a857&"}], "thread_title": "Need help with team Building for D-Tide", "forum_channel_id": "1356200968311803956", "thread_tags": ["1400747088995811358"]}
